WEBVTT

00:05.080 --> 00:07.960
This is the grave I've chosen for Shilang.

00:10.120 --> 00:12.920
This place is called Tiannan Pass.

00:13.320 --> 00:18.640
Composed of two peaks, east and west adjacent to Tianhe.

00:19.200 --> 00:24.720
Only one narrow path in between for troops to pass if a large army marches here.

00:24.800 --> 00:29.360
They will inevitably form a long line front and rear cannot support each other.

00:29.440 --> 00:35.360
We only need to lure the enemy here the vanguard will block Shilang.

00:35.560 --> 00:40.120
The rear guard will take the mountain paths in groups to encircle from behind.

00:40.240 --> 00:45.160
If we encounter enemy troops don't engage just disperse them.

00:45.240 --> 00:49.107
And I will set the central camp on the mountain.

00:49.600 --> 00:54.907
After Shilang's main force is attacked they will surely flee along the mountain paths.

00:55.680 --> 01:00.720
At that time I will personally lead the central army to intercept the fleeing enemy.

01:00.800 --> 01:04.933
This battle must completely annihilate their 50,000 main force.

01:05.440 --> 01:06.840
Completely.

01:08.680 --> 01:14.440
In this way shi Wei's so-called 180,000 army will scatter like birds and beasts.

01:15.600 --> 01:17.600
The Central Plains can be pacified.

01:20.720 --> 01:25.133
The task of luring the enemy is very dangerous who is willing to be the vanguard?

01:25.720 --> 01:30.987
Father you can't catch a wolf without risking the child Your son is willing to be the vanguard.

01:32.080 --> 01:37.360
Good I'll give you a unit of elite cavalry to lure Shilang's main force into the pass.

01:37.440 --> 01:38.840
Yes.

01:43.320 --> 01:45.360
Halt who goes there?

01:45.480 --> 01:49.080
They say Wuzhao people are brave and skilled how.

01:49.200 --> 01:51.867
How come all I see today are cowards?

01:54.200 --> 01:58.293
Everyone inside, listen who dares come out and fight me?

01:59.440 --> 02:00.600
Young General young General.

02:00.680 --> 02:01.240
General Shilang said.

02:01.320 --> 02:06.680
No one is to go out and fight to hell with that I'll kill this brat first young General.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.240
Young General.

02:21.360 --> 02:22.760
Report.

02:23.360 --> 02:24.760
Shilang's army is moving.

02:26.720 --> 02:28.960
Good, the Second Prince is brave.

02:30.120 --> 02:34.000
If Shilang wants to maintain morale he will surely follow.

02:35.720 --> 02:37.120
Zu Yue.

02:37.840 --> 02:43.160
Lead your troops to face the Second Prince head-on fight while retreating Your servant.

02:43.240 --> 02:44.640
Receives the order.

02:48.600 --> 02:50.000
Zhu Yuanzhi.

02:50.960 --> 02:56.720
Half an hour after Shilang's main force enters the pass lead the ambush troops to attack block Shilang's army's retreat.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.907
Your servant receives the order.

03:08.320 --> 03:10.600
Brat, give me back my son's life.

03:28.080 --> 03:29.600
Bad, there's an ambush.

03:30.720 --> 03:32.240
Kill.

03:33.480 --> 03:37.040
Kill.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.520
Kill them.

03:41.760 --> 03:44.880
Kill.

03:56.320 --> 03:58.520
Kill.

04:31.520 --> 04:32.320
Report.

04:32.400 --> 04:38.240
Shilang's army has all entered the pass shilang discovered he's surrounded instead of retreating, he advances sending heavy armor to break through.

04:38.320 --> 04:40.653
One charge has broken through two lines.

04:42.840 --> 04:46.160
They know they're ambushed yet still lead the army deeper.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.320
Report.

04:49.040 --> 04:52.333
Minister Li Dingyuan sent an urgent message from the rear.

05:00.840 --> 05:04.720
Your Majesty some are planning rebellion Minister Li says.

05:04.800 --> 05:09.413
Many gentry believe this battle is hopeless and are stirring panic in the rear.

05:13.280 --> 05:16.800
The Chen and Xie families will handle it.

05:17.800 --> 05:22.080
Your Majesty but the Chen family head is now the Second Prince's mother.

